# Ajani, Outland Chaperone: "-8: Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is your life total. You may put any number of
# nonland permanent cards with mana value 3 or less from among them onto the battlefield. Then shuffle." Ajani gets to 8 loyalty
# with a +1 each turn (T1, T3, T5) and two Tezzeret's Gambits that proliferate (T1, T3), each paid with 2 life, so X is 16 on turn 7.
# The 16 looked-at cards, top first (library cards 8 to 23; the first seven are drawn by then): Agent Bishop (mana value 3, put
# onto the battlefield), Beza (mana value 4, not eligible), Plains (a land), Lightning Bolt (not a permanent), Walking Ballista
# ({X}{X}: its X is 0 in a library, CR 202.3e, so it is eligible and put, and dies at once as a 0/0, CR 704.5f), Sol Ring (eligible but left, the choice being "any
# number"), Ornithopter (mana value 0, put), eight Plains, and Basking Rootwalla as the sixteenth card, exactly at X (put).
# Mox Jet is the seventeenth card, eligible but never looked at, so it stays in the library. Ajani goes to the graveyard with
# no loyalty (CR 704.5i) as the others arrive.

